7" end="01:33.080"><span begin="01:28.907" end="01:29.162">As </span><span begin="01:29.162" end="01:29.386">much </span><span begin="01:29.386" end="01:29.642">as </span><span begin="01:29.642" end="01:29.970">it </span><span begin="01:29.970" end="01:30.632">hurts </span><span begin="01:30.904" end="01:31.160">me </span><span begin="01:31.160" end="01:31.399">in </span><span begin="01:31.399" end="01:31.672">the </span><span begin="01:31.672" end="01:32.503">feels</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.080" end="01:36.973"><span begin="01:33.080" end="01:33.256">I </span><span begin="01:33.256" end="01:33.448">hope </span><span begin="01:33.448" end="01:33.672">he </span><span begin="01:33.672" end="01:33.917">holds </span><span begin="01:33.917" end="01:34.172">your </span><span begin="01:34.172" end="01:34.797">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.973" end="01:41.050"><span begin="01:36.973" end="01:37.165">I </span><span begin="01:37.165" end="01:37.373">pray </span><span begin="01:37.373" end="01:37.645">to </span><span begin="01:37.645" end="01:37.894">God </span><span begin="01:37.894" end="01:38.166">that </span><span begin="01:38.166" end="01:38.650">you </span><span begin="01:38.906" end="01:39.178">live </span><span begin="01:39.178" end="01:40.490">happily</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.050" end="01:44.793"><span begin="01:41.050" end="01:41.947">Appreciate </span><span begin="01:41.947" end="01:42.635">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.793" end="01:51.820"><span begin="01:44.793" end="01:45.082">Who </span><span begin="01:45.082" end="01:45.338">knows </span><span begin="01:45.338" end="01:45.907">maybe </span><span begin="01:45.907" end="01:46.148">one </span><span begin="01:46.148" end="01:48.972">day </span><span begin="01:48.972" end="01:49.179">we'll </span><span begin="01:49.179" end="01:49.381">be </span><span begin="01:49.381" end="01:49.707">a </span><span begin="01:49.707" end="01:51.340">family</span></p>